# Generated artifact — bluebook-of-record :
#   aggregates/framework/mindstream/mindstream.bluebook (Mindstream, MindstreamMember types)
#   aggregates/framework/mindstream/mindstream.fixtures (the boot Mindstream + its boot member)
#
# Until the :overmind generator capability lands (i262), this file is
# hand-derived from those two bluebooks and committed as if it were
# generated. To regenerate manually : read mindstream.fixtures, list
# every MindstreamMember whose lifespan.kind=="one_shot" in
# OVERMIND_CAN_DIE, then add the framework env (HECKS_DAEMON, etc.)
# the boot pipeline needs.

OVERMIND_CAN_DIE=boot
HECKS_DAEMON=1
